{"ref":"BDB, הִלֵּל","hw":"הִלֵּל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">הִלֵּל</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>he hath praised;</em> cf. NH n.pr. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִלֵּל</span>, <em>Hillel</em><strong>)</strong> father of a judge of Israel <a data-ref=\"Judges 12:13\" href=\"/Judges.12.13\">Ju 12:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 12:15\" href=\"/Judges.12.15\">15</a>, called <span dir=\"rtl\">הַפִּרְעָתוֹנִי</span> v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, פִּרְעָתוֹן\" href=\"/BDB,_פִּרְעָתוֹן\", dir=\"rtl\">פִּרְעָתוֹן</a>.","next":"BDB, הִלּוּל","prev":"BDB, הָלַל²"}